1
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,600
The world is in chaos.

2
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,280
How many people

3
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,080
will be displaced

4
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,420
and lose their loved ones?

5
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,640
The pain of losing loved ones...

6
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,530
We both know it well.

7
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,160
What's more,

8
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,580
when a nest is overturned,

9
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,180
no egg remains intact.

10
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:37,680
I finally understand the meaning behind Lady Zhao's music.

11
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:38,880
Thank you, Lady Zhao.

12
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,560
Xiaolian,

13
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:43,360
having a brother like you

14
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:44,930
is truly wonderful.

15
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:47,380
I also wish Lady Zhao all the best.

16
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,400
Thank you.

17
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:24,320
Wine.

18
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,730
Why did you protect me tonight?

19
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,000
Didn't you say

20
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,720
you wanted me to protect you?

21
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,580
I was just saying that.

22
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:04,000
You don't have to take it seriously.

23
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,080
Don't take it seriously.

24
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:15,480
Anyway,

25
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:19,880
you don't have to do this.

26
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:22,680
Oh.

27
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:32,520
You said

28
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,040
you would take me back

29
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,160
to a good life in broad daylight.

30
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,560
Yeah.

31
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,360
I did say that.

32
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,280
Xiaolian.

33
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,360
Uncle.

34
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,000
Xiaolian is awake.

35
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,120
Brother.

36
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,480
Brother.

37
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,300
Are you feeling

38
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,400
a little better today?

39
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,080
Much better.

40
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:47,080
Brother,

41
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,159
where are we?

42
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,400
Aren't we at home?

43
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:54,540
This is someone else's house.

44
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,860
We'll go home tonight.

45
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:01,720
Brother,

46
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,520
is the Lantern Festival coming soon?

47
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,970
Today is the Lantern Festival.

48
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,560
The Lantern Festival.

49
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,000
Then brother,

50
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,730
can I go see the lanterns

51
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:15,640
for the Lantern Festival?

52
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,290
Do you really want to see the lanterns?

53
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,520
Of course.

54
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:23,860
Isn't the Lantern Festival all about seeing lanterns?

55
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:30,360
Then tonight I will hang lanterns all over the courtyard.

56
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,480
We can watch the lanterns at home.

57
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,560
How does that sound?

58
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,560
Great!

59
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,159
I can see the lanterns too!

60
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:46,880
Hey.

61
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:47,200
Sir,

62
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:47,960
stand firm.

63
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,720
This Sister Zhao

64
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,280
looks very familiar.

65
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:09,020
But she doesn't smile.

66
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:13,240
Is it because my brother's story is boring?

67
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,970
You know my story is boring too.

68
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:16,960
You like to smile,

69
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,610
how can you make others smile with you?

70
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,720
Please don't mind her, Lady Zhao.

71
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,640
My sister and I

72
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:25,100
are used to joking around.

73
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:27,800
It's fine.

74
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,560
I also felt

75
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:32,000
Xiaolian looked familiar just now.

76
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,000
I zoned out

77
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,720
for a moment.

78
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:39,490
You look so pretty when you smile, Sister.

79
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:42,840
You have the most beautiful smile Xiaolian has ever seen.

80
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,840
You must smile more, Sister,

81
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,000
smile more,

82
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:48,400
then you won't be in so much pain.

83
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,200
You can tell

84
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:54,140
that I have an illness?

85
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:55,640
Of course.

86
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,600
We are the same kind of people.

87
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:02,000
So you should smile more,

88
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:02,840
okay?

89
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:04,880
Meng.

90
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:08,180
Have you seen the Chief come back?

91
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,080
Not yet.

92
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:09,880
What's wrong?

93
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:13,160
The Chief insisted on going to catch the suspect alone,

94
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,440
and wouldn't let me follow.

95
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:15,680
It's been over two hours,

96
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,880
and they still haven't returned.

97
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:18,080
I am truly worried.

98
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:22,720
Oh.

99
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,920
You have a daughter

100
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:27,330
who went missing when she was five.

101
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:30,000
You have been looking for her for over a decade.

102
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,360
Now,

103
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,360
she should be around Lord Chu's age.

104
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,440
Sir,

105
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:38,760
does your daughter

106
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,640
have any distinguishing marks?

107
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,200
My daughter

108
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,120
has a

109
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:48,450
pink plum blossom birthmark on her thigh.

110
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,240
Sir.

111
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:06,280
Are you sure she has a pink plum blossom birthmark on her leg?

112
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,240
I am sure.

113
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:10,640
She has a pink birthmark.

114
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,360
Sister.

115
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,320
Sister,

116
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,330
how did it go?

117
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,200
Cui Hong is taken care of.

118
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,720
According to the original plan,

119
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,840
in half an hour,

120
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:25,570
we should leave for Wuyou City.

121
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:28,320
Where is the Daoist priest?

122
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,520
Everything is ready.

123
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:32,130
They are waiting for orders in the guest room.

124
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:36,520
Have you been overthinking these past two days,

125
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:38,179
and tired yourself out again?

126
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:42,210
I just tried a new medicine.

127
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:43,600
Maybe

128
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,040
my body hasn't adapted to it yet.

129
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:47,960
New medicine?

130
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,080
Did you find a new method?

131
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:50,880
Yes.

132
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:52,960
That's great.

133
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,280
That's really great.

134
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,200
Sister,

135
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,920
is it time to leave?

136
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,560
It's just that

137
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:06,200
Liang Shicheng's personal letter hasn't arrived yet.

138
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:08,000
Could something have happened?

139
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,920
You're probably overthinking it, sister.

140
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:11,760
It should

141
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,600
just be delayed by an hour or two.

142
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,400
It's fine.

143
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,720
We caught Cui Hong today.

144
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:18,440
He said

145
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:23,160
Liang Shicheng and Chancellor Cai were fighting behind the scenes,

146
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:26,040
which is why they wouldn't let me go.

147
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:28,940
If the two of them noticed something,

148
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,850
then it would be extremely dangerous.

149
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,760
Don't worry, sister.

150
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,160
There's still time.

151
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,440
If this doesn't work,

152
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,260
we'll try another way.

153
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:53,040
I'm just afraid there are no other ways.

154
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:55,800
There is one,

155
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,360
but

156
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,080
it's much more dangerous.
